It also applies to modifications of those Covered Materials to the extent
permission from EVOLIQ is required. Third-party materials are excluded as
described in section 5.

2. Free personal use

An individual may download, copy, run and privately modify the Covered
Materials, without a license fee, solely for Personal Use.

"Personal Use" means private, non-commercial use by a natural person for
their own purposes. It excludes use for or on behalf of an employer, client,
business or other organization; professional work; and any use intended to
obtain a direct or indirect commercial advantage or monetary compensation.
Private learning and hobby experimentation that meet this definition are free.

You may share unmodified copies without charge for Personal Use, provided
this entire license and all applicable third-party notices are preserved.
No commercial rights may be granted to recipients under this permission.
Distribution of modified Covered Materials requires EVOLIQ's written permission.

3. Paid commercial license required

Commercial, professional and organizational use of the Covered Materials is
not granted by this personal-use license. It requires a separate written,
paid commercial license agreement with EVOLIQ s.r.o. before such use begins.
The commercial agreement specifies the price, permitted scope and other terms.
Downloading the model or paying an arbitrary amount does not create such an
agreement.

Examples requiring a commercial agreement include internal business
operations, work for an employer or client, integration into a product or
service, hosted inference or API services, and using the model to produce
documents or other outputs for a commercial activity. A free-to-end-user
product or service is not Personal Use merely because it charges no fee.

